---
title: Creamy Blue Cheese Dressing
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Sauces & Dressings
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@low-fat cottage cheese{1%c}
@prepared horseradish{1/4%tsp}
@lemon juice{2.5%Tbsp}
@crumbled Blue Cheese{2%Tbsp}
@skim milk{1/3%c}
@white pepper{1/16%tsp}
@seasoned salt{1%tsp}

Combine cottage cheese, lemon juice, milk, salt, horseradish and pepper in blender. Blend smooth. Stir Blue Cheese into mixture. Makes about 1 1/2 cups.
